Dear {!Get_Opp_Record.Name},

Thank you for confirming your revisit to {!Get_Opp_Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}. We are delighted to welcome you back and help you discover more about your future home

Revisit Details:
•	Date & Time: {!Get_Opp_Record.EYI_CIF_Record__r.EYI_Visit_Date__c}
•	Project Name: {!Get_Opp_Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.Name}
•	Location: {!Get_Opp_Record.EYI_Project_Enquired__r.EYI_Project_Site_Location_Link__c}

Please use the OTP {!Get_Opp_Record.EYI_Revisit_OTP__c} to complete your check-in upon arrival.

At Panchshil, we deeply value your trust and look forward to making your visit a seamless and enriching experience.  Please don’t hesitate to reach out to us should you have any questions or need further assistance. prior to your visit.

Best regards,
Team Panchshil
